<!-- ================= SHIPPING POLICY SECTION ================= -->

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
 
        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5">

                <p class="text-muted">
                    Last Updated: January 01, 2026
                </p>

                <p>
                    Thank you for shopping with us. This Shipping & Delivery Policy outlines our procedures regarding order processing, shipment, delivery timelines, and related information.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">1. Order Processing</h4>

                <ul>
                    <li>Orders are processed after successful payment confirmation.</li>
                    <li>Orders are generally processed within 1–3 business days.</li>
                    <li>Orders placed on weekends or public holidays may be processed on the next business day.</li>
                    <li>Processing times may vary during peak seasons, sales events, or promotional campaigns.</li>
                </ul>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">2. Shipping Coverage</h4>

                <p>
                    We currently deliver to most serviceable locations within India. Delivery availability may vary depending on courier service coverage and regional restrictions.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">3. Estimated Delivery Time</h4>

                <ul>
                    <li>Metro Cities: 2–5 Business Days</li>
                    <li>Other Cities & Towns: 4–8 Business Days</li>
                    <li>Remote Locations: 5–12 Business Days</li>
                </ul>

                <p>
                    Delivery timelines are estimates and may vary due to factors beyond our control.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">4. Shipping Charges</h4>

                <ul>
                    <li>Shipping charges, if applicable, will be displayed during checkout.</li>
                    <li>Free shipping may be available on selected products or order values.</li>
                    <li>Promotional free-shipping offers may be subject to specific terms and conditions.</li>
                </ul>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">5. Order Tracking</h4>

                <p>
                    Once your order is shipped, you will receive tracking details via email, SMS, or your registered account dashboard. Tracking information may take up to 24 hours to become active.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">6. Delivery Attempts</h4>

                <ul>
                    <li>Courier partners may attempt delivery multiple times.</li>
                    <li>If delivery fails due to incorrect address or customer unavailability, additional charges may apply.</li>
                    <li>Repeated failed delivery attempts may result in order cancellation.</li>
                </ul>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">7. Delayed Deliveries</h4>

                <p>
                    Delivery may be delayed due to weather conditions, natural disasters, transportation disruptions, public holidays, government restrictions, or unforeseen circumstances.
                </p>

                <p>
                    While we strive to ensure timely delivery, we cannot guarantee delivery dates in such situations.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">8. Incorrect Shipping Information</h4>

                <p>
                    Customers are responsible for providing accurate shipping details. We are not responsible for delays or failed deliveries resulting from incorrect or incomplete address information.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">9. Damaged Packages</h4>

                <p>
                    If your package appears damaged at the time of delivery, please:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Take clear photos of the package and product.</li>
                    <li>Notify us within 48 hours of receiving the order.</li>
                    <li>Retain all original packaging materials for verification.</li>
                </ul>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">10. Lost Shipments</h4>

                <p>
                    If your order is marked as delivered but has not been received, please contact our customer support team. We will coordinate with the courier partner to investigate the issue.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">11. International Shipping</h4>

                <p>
                    International shipping availability, delivery timelines, customs duties, taxes, and import charges may vary by destination country. Customers are responsible for any applicable customs fees unless otherwise stated.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">12. Changes to This Policy</h4>

                <p>
                    We reserve the right to modify this Shipping & Delivery Policy at any time. Any updates will be posted on this page along with the revised effective date.
                </p>

                <hr>

                <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">13. Contact Us</h4>

                <p>
                    If you have any questions regarding shipping or delivery, please contact us:
                </p>

                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li>
                        <strong>Email:</strong>
                        <a href="mailto:@Const.COM_EMAIL">@Const.COM_EMAIL</a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Phone:</strong>
                        <a href="tel:@Const.COM_CONTACT">@Const.COM_CONTACT</a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Address:</strong>
                        @Const.COM_ADDRESS
                    </li>
                </ul>

            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
    
</section>

<script src="~/js/jquery-3.7.1.min.js"></script>
